      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Purpose: A modal dialog for users to create a new project by typing an AI prompt.\n- State Management: Tracks input text and loading state during submission.\n- API Interaction: Sends a POST request to /api/projects/create-with-prompt using ky to create the project.\n- Post-Success Actions: Shows a success toast, closes the modal, clears the input, and redirects the user to the new project page.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Purpose: A modal dialog for users to create a new project by typing an AI prompt.\n- State Management: Tracks input text and loading state during submission.\n- API Interaction: Sends a POST request to /api/projects/create-with-prompt using ky to create the project.\n- Post-Success Actions: Shows a success toast, closes the modal, clears the input, and redirects the user to the new project page.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
